  "rationale": "Both answers are valid ordinary equivalents, but the different-common-word relation materially overstates the national split. English extension cord is also used in Malaysian contexts, and Indonesian usage includes overlapping kabel sambungan terminology. The cue and sense are accurate; no false-friend contrast is needed because the forms do not create a documented cross-variety false friend.",
