    {
      "subject": "National split and overlap",
      "conclusion": "The national distinction is overstated. Malaysian sources use extension cord, extension wire, wayar penyambung, and wayar sambungan; Indonesian sources use kabel ekstensi and kabel sambungan.",
      "material_risk": true,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://oshmo.umpsa.edu.my/images/manual/OCP-L3-013-Prosedur-KKP-Pejabat-Pentadbiran.pdf",
