        "https://shopee.co.id/list/Kabel/Extension"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "English cue and sense",
      "conclusion": "The cue extension cord correctly denotes an extra wire used to bring electricity to equipment farther from a socket; the supplied sense is aligned.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/extension-cord"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Indonesian answer",
      "conclusion": "kabel ekstensi is an attested Indonesian term for the target object, though kabel sambungan and related commercial forms also occur.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://www.detik.com/properti/tips-dan-panduan/d-8516329/infografis-barang-yang-aman-dan-berisiko-dicolokkan-ke-kabel-ekstensi",
        "https://www.indotrading.com/jual-kabel-ekstensi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Malaysian answer",
      "conclusion": "wayar sambungan is understandable and attested as a Malaysian equivalent, but it is not uniquely Malaysian; wayar penyambung and English extension cord or extension wire are also used.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://oshmo.umpsa.edu.my/images/manual/OCP-L3-013-Prosedur-KKP-Pejabat-Pentadbiran.pdf",
        "https://www.tnb.com.my/assets/newsclip/27062016b.pdf",
        "https://saidina.com.my/product/extension-wire/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Final relation",
      "conclusion": "different-common-word is not supported as a clean variety contrast. A shared-common-form or shared-synonym-preference relation is more accurate.",
